NOTICE — WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

This licence covers only the code and results produced by this study.

It does NOT cover the FairEval benchmark inputs (questions, candidate answers
and human labels) from https://github.com/i-Eval/FairEval. That repository
carries no licence file, so this study redistributes none of its contents.
The input verifier fetches them at a pinned commit and checks SHA-256 and byte
length before any run proceeds.

The released judge-verdict files have been redacted: every maximal run of
eight or more consecutive words appearing verbatim in the upstream questions or
candidate answers is replaced by a placeholder carrying the SHA-256 prefix of
the removed span. See DEVIATIONS.md, entry D-21.

It also does NOT cover the model weights, which are third-party.
